{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "公证人与验证者",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 113.42,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "换两种框架，单点换了位置。",
   "spoken": "换两种框架，单点换了位置。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.771
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "Corda 不广播交易，数据只发给需要知道的参与方。",
   "spoken": "Corda 不广播交易，数据只发给需要知道的参与方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 4.22,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 4.313,
   "speechEnd": 8.012
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "防止同一个状态被花两次，靠的是公证人。",
   "spoken": "防止同一个状态被花两次，靠的是公证人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 8.44,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 8.44,
   "speechEnd": 12.17
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "非验证型公证人只看输入引用，看不到完整交易，隐私更好。",
   "spoken": "非验证型公证人只看输入引用，看不到完整交易，隐私更好。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 12.58,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 12.58,
   "speechEnd": 17.625
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "可如果整个网络只有一个公证人，运营方作恶，就能给同一个状态签两次，造成双花。",
   "spoken": "可如果整个网络只有一个公证人，运营方作恶，就能给同一个状态签两次，造成双花。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 18.08,
   "dur": 7.6,
   "speechStart": 18.08,
   "speechEnd": 25.509
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "防御是改成集群，分给不同的运营方。",
   "spoken": "防御是改成集群，分给不同的运营方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 25.9,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 25.9,
   "speechEnd": 28.933
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "节点之间协商时，对方发来的数据，要先校验，再使用。",
   "spoken": "节点之间协商时，对方发来的数据，要先较验，再使用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 29.4,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 29.4,
   "speechEnd": 33.811
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "合约代码作为附件随交易分发，always-accept 这种约束只用于测试，生产环境不能用。",
   "spoken": "合约代码作为附件随交易分发，always-accept 这种约束只用于测试，生产环境不能用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 34.26,
   "dur": 7.84,
   "speechStart": 34.26,
   "speechEnd": 41.902
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "再看 Besu。",
   "spoken": "再看 Besu。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 42.32,
   "dur": 0.88,
   "speechStart": 42.32,
   "speechEnd": 43.016
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "2026 年 9 月，Besu 公布了一项 QBFT 漏洞。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 9 月，Besu 公布了一项 QBFT 漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 43.42,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 43.526,
   "speechEnd": 47.65
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "启用 Shanghai 及之后的分叉，一名拜占庭验证者，能注入未经授权的提款。",
   "spoken": "启用 Shanghai 及之后的分叉，一名拜占庭验证者，能注入未经授权的提款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 48.04,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 48.04,
   "speechEnd": 54.039
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "诚实的验证者照常执行，照常确定，原生币凭空多了出来。",
   "spoken": "诚实的验证者照常执行，照常确定，原生币凭空多了出来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 54.42,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 54.42,
   "speechEnd": 59.87
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "4 个验证者，按规范只容忍 1 个作恶。",
   "spoken": "4 个验证者，按规范只容忍 1 个作恶。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 60.32,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 60.32,
   "speechEnd": 63.567
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "可这一次，诚实节点的验证规则本身缺了一项，一名验证者就够了。",
   "spoken": "可这一次，诚实节点的验证规则本身缺了一项，一名验证者就够了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 63.98,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 64.078,
   "speechEnd": 69.984
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "合同能让你事后追责，却拦不住状态被写错。",
   "spoken": "合同能让你事后追责，却拦不住状态被写错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 70.36,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 70.36,
   "speechEnd": 74.468
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "同一时期的另一项公告里，能连上足够多验证者端口的节点，用大体积提案，就能阻止网络最终确定。",
   "spoken": "同一时期的另一项公告里，能连上足够多验证者端口的节点，用大体积提案，就能阻止网络最终确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 74.9,
   "dur": 8.56,
   "speechStart": 74.996,
   "speechEnd": 83.232
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "所以 P2P 监听也是攻击面，要在网络层限制谁能连到验证者。",
   "spoken": "所以 P2P 监听也是攻击面，要在网络层限制谁能连到验证者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 83.68,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 83.777,
   "speechEnd": 89.386
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "Besu 的本地准入规则只管本节点，每个成员都要配置，并且核对一致。",
   "spoken": "Besu 的本地准入规则只管本节点，每个成员都要配置，并且核对一致。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-17.wav",
   "start": 89.82,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 89.92,
   "speechEnd": 96.052
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "还有一种风险，没有漏洞也会发生。",
   "spoken": "还有一种风险，没有漏洞也会发生。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-18.wav",
   "start": 96.44,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 96.44,
   "speechEnd": 99.7
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "GoQuorum 的仓库已经归档，Tessera 已经弃用。",
   "spoken": "GoQuorum 的仓库已经归档，Tessera 已经弃用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-19.wav",
   "start": 100.1,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 100.199,
   "speechEnd": 103.464
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "还在用它们的网络，从此没有上游的安全修复。",
   "spoken": "还在用它们的网络，从此没有上游的安全修复。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-20.wav",
   "start": 103.92,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 103.92,
   "speechEnd": 107.477
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-21",
   "text": "依赖这些功能的网络，只能自己维护，或者尽快迁移。",
   "spoken": "依赖这些功能的网络，只能自己维护，或者尽快迁移。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-21.wav",
